<view class="tab-page"><view class="masthead"><view class="kicker">未界 / CONNECTION</view><view class="page-heading">连接申请</view><view class="deck editorial">相似的背景，不一样的故事。</view></view><view class="page-body"><view class="connect-poster"><view class="conversation-photo"><image wx:if="{{!coverFailed}}" src="/assets/editorial/conversation.jpg" mode="aspectFill" binderror="onCoverError"/><view wx:else class="state">交流主题配图暂不可用</view><text class="photo-note">图库主题配图 · 非活动现场</text></view><view class="connect-title">认识一个人，<view>听听另一种经历。</view></view><view class="connect-caption">与相似背景的前辈交流</view><view class="status-pill">申请入口尚未开放</view><button class="primary application-open" bindtap="toggleForm">{{formOpen ? '收起，保留本页填写' : '填写交流申请 · 样板'}}</button><view class="small">提供背景和想聊的问题，由未界运营人工匹配。</view>
<view wx:if="{{formOpen}}" class="application-form"><view class="subtitle">你的背景与交流方向</view><view class="form-note">本地填写演示：不上传、不保存、不提交给运营。请勿填写真实手机号或简历。</view><view wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="id" class="form-field"><label for="field-{{item.id}}">{{item.label}}</label><textarea wx:if="{{item.multiline}}" id="field-{{item.id}}" value="{{values[item.id] || ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindinput="updateField" maxlength="{{item.max}}" placeholder="{{item.placeholder}}"/><input wx:else id="field-{{item.id}}" value="{{values[item.id] || ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindinput="updateField" maxlength="{{item.max}}" placeholder="{{item.placeholder}}"/><view wx:if="{{item.id === 'experience'}}"><view class="small">正式接入后可填写介绍或上传简历，二选一。</view><button disabled="{{true}}" class="resume-unavailable">上传简历 · 尚未接入</button></view></view><view class="form-note">正式服务拟由运营查看资料，用于人工匹配。资料不公开；向咨询对象转交前需另行确认。真实提交将在隐私说明与后端接入后开放。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="checkForm">检查填写 · 不提交</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="toggleForm">收起，保留本页填写</button><view class="form-result">{{result}}</view></view></view>
<view class="interest-card"><image src="/assets/editorial/outing.png"/><view><view class="interest-title">职业兴趣探索</view><view class="small">帮助整理兴趣与想了解的方向</view><text class="status-pill">测评尚未开放</text></view></view><view class="section-head"><view class="subtitle">一次交流，如何开始</view></view><view class="step"><text class="number">01</text><view><view class="flat-title">说说想聊的方向</view><view class="small">职业方向、行业与希望交流的问题。</view></view></view><view class="step"><text class="number">02</text><view><view class="flat-title">未界审核与撮合</view><view class="small">由运营方核实背景和交流意愿。</view></view></view><view class="step"><text class="number">03</text><view><view class="flat-title">双方确认后安排时间</view><view class="small">不是即时聊天，也不会直接公开前辈联系方式。</view></view></view><view class="notice">人工匹配与真人交流服务尚未开放；当前仅可体验申请表填写，不会生成匹配结果。</view></view></view>
